OL,3,ACatherine Zeta-Jones' daughter says    
OL,4,Aparents warned her about 'nepo baby'   
OL,5,Alabel                                  
OL,7,FCatherine Zeta-Jones's daughter has    
OL,8,Fsaid her parents warned her people     
OL,9,Fmight have "preconceived notions" about
OL,10,Fher embarking on an acting career, as  
OL,11,Fshe shared her views on the "nepo baby"
OL,12,Flabel.                                 
OL,14,FCarys Douglas, 23, made her stage debut
OL,15,Fthis year, playing the lead role of    
OL,16,FNina in Anton Chekhov's The Seagull in 
OL,17,FBrooklyn, New York.                    
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
